                        "entry_id": "c32649cc-b1a7-3c0d-8907-cb994d5e7266",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A shapeshifter who can change between leopard and human form."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ab10331-0044-4206-992a-e13bb54ecfc9",
                                "sense_id": "48c30c9d-0c06-3d6f-984b-9ff14c67fb17",
                                "text": "They are believed to be \"Ju-Ju\" or were-leopards, and in this guise to roam through the forest in bands, bent on evil and destruction."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1346574-08f3-449e-8a34-76c439e6b9ea",
                                "sense_id": "48c30c9d-0c06-3d6f-984b-9ff14c67fb17",
                                "text": "A) “One of them was a wereleopard; the other was a werewolf; both of them were strippers.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e5af5b78-d43c-4f3d-8576-714d5b5cdd70",
                                "sense_id": "48c30c9d-0c06-3d6f-984b-9ff14c67fb17",
                                "text": "While there'd been whispers about the Pack being unhappy with me for entangling myself with a wereleopard, Caitlyn wasn't just a wereleopard to me. She was my mate. A wolf didn't choose those kinds of things."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
